{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Welcome to The Green Way,</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> where your farming dreams await! Start with a humble plot of land and transform it into a flourishing agricultural empire. Cultivate crops, tend to livestock, and sell your produce to build wealth and reputation in the community. But farming is just the beginning; immerse yourself in a world where every decision impacts your success and lifestyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Key Features:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Farm Management</strong>: Plant and harvest a variety of crops, manage livestock, and optimize your farm for maximum efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Business Expansion</strong>: Expand your holdings by purchasing more land and increasing your production capabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Market and Shop Management</strong>: Sell your goods at local markets or open your own shop. Negotiate prices and build relationships with customers to grow your reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Home and Lifestyle</strong>: Upgrade your farmhouse, purchase vehicles, and decorate with luxurious items as your wealth grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique Land Customization</strong>: Buy building plots, design your land, and construct houses, walls, towers, markets, and more. Create a personalized and unique farmstead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Community Engagement</strong>: Interact with neighbors, participate in festivals, and contribute to the local economy to become a respected member of the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Achievements and Challenges</strong>: Complete challenges and earn achievements that showcase your farming prowess and business acumen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Create Your Legacy</strong>: From a small-time farmer to a magnate of agriculture, forge your path in The Green Way. Explore, expand, and experience the joys and challenges of rural life as you build a legacy that will be remembered for generations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay Features :</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Farming Feature:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111980/extras/GreenWay_farming.gif?t=1744886195\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Purchase Feature:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111980/extras/GreenWay_BuyItems.gif?t=1744886195\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Building Mode :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111980/extras/BuildingModeTheGreenWayX4.gif?t=1744886195\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join us in The Green Way and embark on your farming adventure today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Support us by adding the game to your Wishlist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And Join Our Discord Community </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3111980?t=1744886195","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3111980?t=1744886195","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111980/6555eb4c191c544860558602d4356d8901f9df29/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744886195","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a